{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19019","headline":"酬令狐相公首夏闲居书怀见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公首夏闲居书怀见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蕙草芳未歇，绿槐阴已成。\n金罍唯独酌，瑶瑟有离声。\n翔泳各殊势，篇章空寄情。\n应怜三十载，未变使君名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}